          "description": "Where a node's real material lives -- reached two ways: a Declaration's landing-surface (the content a graph shows before you open any particular View), and a View's surface-delegate (the content a View shows instead of owning its own). Both relationships land on the same root port; smoke-content proved that locally, this template proves it across a real cross-template link, via the portal back to view-template."
